flowchart LR
    CAM[Bed camera] --> PI[Raspberry Pi per bed]
    PI --> VIDEO[Independent video plane]
    PI --> WATCH[Cheap motion/person watcher]
    WATCH -->|empty| IDLE[Low-load EMPTY]
    WATCH -->|person or motion| ACTIVE[OCCUPIED/BURST]
    ACTIVE --> ROI[Automatic bed segmentation and ROI]
    ACTIVE --> POSE[Pose and posture]
    POSE --> WINDOW[Observed-only 10 Hz<br/>same track 30 x 109]
    WINDOW --> TCN[Lightweight TCN]
    ROI --> FUSION[Bed + pose + kinematic + TCN fusion]
    POSE --> FUSION
    TCN --> FUSION
    FUSION --> OUTBOX[Persistent local result outbox]
    OUTBOX --> CONTROL[Central control API :8020]
    CONTROL --> MONITOR[Monitoring and alerts]
    CONTROL --> DATA[Review and retraining data]
    GPU[RTX 5080 server<br/>training and selective second pass] --> BUNDLE[Versioned model bundle]
    BUNDLE --> PI
    FUSION -. high risk or low quality .-> GPU
